revision            0

description         Shared Compilation Cache

long_description    ${name} is a ccache-like compiler caching tool. It is used as a compiler \
                    wrapper and avoids compilation when possible, storing cached results either \
                    on local disk or in one of several cloud storage backends. \
                    ${name} includes support for caching the compilation of C/C++ code, Rust, \
                    as well as NVIDIA's CUDA using nvcc.

categories          devel
